# 3ds Max Wavefront OBJ Exporter v0.97b - (c)2007 guruware
# File Created: 01.10.2015 14:06:11
#
# Edited 2026-09-25 for NeoForge's modern OBJ loader (the original data, kept, minus these changes):
#  - map_Ka/map_Kd pointed at the original author's absolute Windows path (C:\Thaumcraft\...), which the
#    modern loader can't resolve - now the standard "#Material__25" texture-variable form, bound by the model
#    JSON's own "textures" map.
#  - Ka/Kd raised from 0.588 to 1.0: the loader multiplies vertex colour by Kd, which would darken every
#    crystal to 59% on top of its aspect tint. The 1.12 pipeline this mesh was authored for didn't do that.
#  - neoforge_TintIndex 0: the real aspect colour tint (crystal_aer etc. each tint by their own aspect), same
#    tint index the previous placeholder box used.

newmtl Material__25
	Ns 10.0000
	Ni 1.5000
	d 1.0000
	Tr 0.0000
	Tf 1.0000 1.0000 1.0000
	illum 2
	Ka 1.0000 1.0000 1.0000
	Kd 1.0000 1.0000 1.0000
	Ks 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000
	Ke 0.0000 0.0000 0.0000
	map_Ka #Material__25
	map_Kd #Material__25
	neoforge_TintIndex 0
